    "date": "2026-04-06T13:05:56Z",
    "text": "Diesel Emissions Reduction Act of 2025 \n\nThis bill reauthorizes through FY2029 a diesel emissions reduction program under which the Environmental Protection Agency provides grants, rebates, or loans for replacing diesel engines or retrofitting the engines with pollution control technologies."
